WEBVTT

00:00:01.209 --> 00:00:04.170
Drawings and the 3D model
of a building drift apart.

00:00:04.355 --> 00:00:07.446
Checking every tag and size
by hand takes days.

00:00:07.843 --> 00:00:11.140
AI can read a drawing,
but it can be confidently wrong.

00:00:12.154 --> 00:00:15.227
Iris lets AI read the drawing,
then checks its work.

00:00:16.252 --> 00:00:19.558
Gemini reads every tag
and size on the PDF sheet.

00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:23.959
Then each item is checked
against the PDF's own text.

00:00:24.221 --> 00:00:27.158
119 of 123 are confirmed.

00:00:27.553 --> 00:00:28.945
The rest go to a person.

00:00:29.955 --> 00:00:32.930
Then Iris compares the sheet
with the 3D model.

00:00:33.194 --> 00:00:35.216
On this clean sheet, nothing differs.

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:38.496
Then a sheet with four planted mistakes.

00:00:38.696 --> 00:00:43.196
Iris finds exactly those four:
a wrong size, a missing tray,

00:00:43.366 --> 00:00:46.602
a duct that is really a pipe,
and a missing branch.

00:00:47.867 --> 00:00:49.027
AI proposes.

00:00:49.027 --> 00:00:50.283
Geometry proves.

00:00:50.414 --> 00:00:51.833
The engineer decides.

00:00:52.304 --> 00:00:55.071
Try it at iris-techjays.web.app.
